{"tuid":"ed7uayx9m2etcx9f","pageVersion":1,"fetchedAt":"2026-09-30T09:55:56.751Z","record":{"colophon":{"generator":"ifdb.org/viewgame","generatorversion":1,"originated":"2023-05-30"},"identification":{"ifids":[]},"bibliographic":{"title":"最后的颂歌","author":"Meriya Molin","language":"zh-CN","firstpublished":"2023","description":"当渡船到达多兰纳尔码头时，月亮正从夜雾之中迢迢浮现。平静的小镇上渔灯点点，螃蟹闪烁着青白色的磷光，在绵延的沙地上留下一串串浅浅的足迹。你走下船舷，在码头上回头望去——在那巍峨的树冠之间，达纳苏斯的灯火仿佛漂浮在云端，同星辰交相辉映，不似人间。 <br> <br>你回想起最后一次与导师艾尔·月影会面时的情形。他交给你一封信，说：“我本该亲自向安努长老引荐你，孩子。拿上这封信，到黑海岸的圣林中去吧。我相信你就是古树议会的德鲁伊们所要找的那个人。安努无所不知，也许它早已预言了你的命运。”"},"contacts":{"url":"https://bbs.nga.cn/read.php?tid=35394066"},"ifdb":{"tuid":"ed7uayx9m2etcx9f","pageversion":1,"link":"https://ifdb.org/viewgame?id=ed7uayx9m2etcx9f","coverart":{"url":"https://ifdb.org/coverart?id=ed7uayx9m2etcx9f&version=1"},"primaryPlayOnlineUrl":"https://thelastode.netlify.app/","downloads":{"links":[{"url":"https://thelastode.netlify.app/","playOnlineUrl":"https://thelastode.netlify.app/","title":"Play Online","isGame":true,"format":"hypertextgame"}]},"averageRating":null,"ratingCountAvg":0,"ratingCountTot":0,"tags":[{"name":"fan fiction","tagcnt":1,"gamecnt":146},{"name":"multiple endings","tagcnt":1,"gamecnt":964},{"name":"second person","tagcnt":1,"gamecnt":404},{"name":"World of Warcraft","tagcnt":1,"gamecnt":4}]}}}
